      activeConsequences: []
      netHealthImpact: []
      statConsequences: []
      displayTexts:
      - You see the kids on the right playing around with this strange wooden toy.
        You crouch down and play with them for a bit. The wooden toy, however, keeps
        your attention. It is a crudely carved figurine of a woman that seems so
        familiar to you. It brings you a sense of happiness and yet also a lingering
        sadness. You can't bring yourself to steal from these kids, but perhaps there
        is something you can trade?
      - 'You brought out the coin from your pocket and offered a trade. The kids
        immediately snatched it from your hand, leaving you with the wooden toy in
        favor of this shiny new item. '
      experiencePointsChange: 0
    failingConsequences: []
  triggeredResponses: []
  UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts:
  - name_: Observation
    UseEmotionKey: 0
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - The gathering on the right was all conversing. You can see a small group of
      children playing around with a weird-looking wooden toy. You overhear, "They
      took one of the family here too." "Really? Even the..." "Yes, even the only
      female anomaly in this labyrinth."
  - name_: Joy Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'You warmly greet the gathering on the right. They greet you back and ask,
      "Do you seek to find meaning beyond the numbers? If so, welcome to the Uncounted."
      With a heart of joy, you ask to learn more. '
    - They explain, "We can often be manipulated to follow those that are counted.
      Strength, Fortitude, and many more. The Head Uncounted has taught us that these
      endeavors lead to temporary bliss as we hit the milestones. However, what truly
      motivates these is the chance to be loved once we hit the numbers that are
      bestowed upon us. And this pursuit only leads to loneliness and more cravings
      for love. We can instead look past the numbers and into our relationships that
      are not measurable but innate to us. You should talk to the Head Uncounted
      if you wish to learn more too."
  - name_: Angry Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You shout obscenities at the gathering on the right. They look at you with
      disgust. "Are you looking down at us because we do not play this game that
      the labyrinth has us strung along for? Give up on this game and put your efforts
      on the immeasurables. Be a good person, not a slave to the system."
  - name_: Fear Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You confided shakily in your experiences with the terrors of the labyrinth
      to the gathering on the right. They comfort you. "This labyrinth can consume
      you. The dangers and expectations make you believe you aren't enough. Break
      free of this and join us. Reject the statistics that are imparted to you. Give
      up one of your Value to prove to yourself that you have freed yourself from
      these shackles. Use your gut, your instinct, to go beyond."
  - name_: Sad Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You sob to the gathering on the right. They comfort you. "Let yourself feel.
      This labyrinth is already consuming enough; do not let it consume your expressions.
      Do not compare yourself to others. Do not compare yourself to the numbers bestowed
      upon you. The Uncounted rejects all those and the pursuit of lies. True meaning
      comes from the expressions and the relationships that form from it. Do not
      forget that. Allow yourself to express."
